 hinchada pero la balanza no cambia, no es tu culpa: es líquido retenido. Pídelas y paga cuando lleguen a tu casa. 💧","transcript":null,"callToAction":"WHATSAPP MESSAGE","landingPageUrl":"https://api.whatsapp.com/send","landingPageDomain":"api.whatsapp.com","ctaDescription":"✅PRODUCTO GARANTIZADO","ctaLinkDescription":"ENVIO GRATIS"},"metrics":{"reach":null,"aggregatedReach":null,"estimatedSpend":null,"duplicates":116,"reachDelta1d":null,"reachDelta7d":null,"reachDelta30d":null},"audience":{"targetedCountries":["CO","EC","GT"],"mainCountry":null,"gender":null,"ageMin":null,"ageMax":null},"rank":{"positionInPage":7,"currentRank":7,"rankDelta":0,"improvementPct":1.47},"flags":{"isEuAd":null,"isLowReach":false,"isMediaChanged":true,"hasPartnerBadge":false}},{"id":"facebook_1049615861389269","collationId":"1452353073393763","platform":"facebook","status":"active","createdAt":"2026-09-02T01:07:28.405Z","firstSeenAt":"2026-09-01T07:00:00.000Z","lastSeenAt":"2026-11-26T19:33:14.316Z","daysRunning":88,"media":{"type":"image","thumbnailUrl":null,"mediaUrl":"https://medias.trendtrack.io/facebook/image/87fe4841492d5419d316f10f2d50187c993f8551534f708a2869edd9b867bc5c.jpg"},"advertiser":{"id":"300783529776232","name":"Dra Nancy Camargo","logoUrl":"https://medias.trendtrack.io/profile_picture/300783529776232.jpg","facebookPageId":"300783529776232","liveAdsCount":476,"reach30d":0,"totalReach":0,"countriesCount":1,"facebookLikes":4884,"instagramFollowers":null},"content":{"title":null,"body":"Probaste las pastillas de agua… y terminaste viviendo pegada al baño. 🚽\n\nSí, te deshinchaste un poco, pero a qué precio: corriendo al baño cada 20 minutos, deshidratada, con la boca seca y sintiéndote peor que antes. Así nadie quiere deshincharse.\n\nExiste una forma más suave. Nuestras Gotas de Drenaje Linfático ayudan a tu cuerpo a soltar el líquido retenido de forma gradual —te deshinchas sin deshidratarte y sin ese efecto brusco de los diuréticos.\n\n✅ Suelta el líquido retenido sin corr