{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01FErStM1UozW35nNC1okjU5","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"requestId\":\"3b3be57d-9e3d-4e9d-b959-70c59ec4847e\",\"data\":[{\"id\":\"facebook_983044337861931\",\"collationId\":\"1142745345594612\",\"platform\":\"facebook\",\"status\":\"active\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-06-17T02:43:21.485Z\",\"firstSeenAt\":\"2026-06-15T07:00:00.000Z\",\"lastSeenAt\":\"2026-11-27T01:39:17.994Z\",\"daysRunning\":166,\"media\":{\"type\":\"video\",\"thumbnailUrl\":\"https://medias.trendtrack.io/facebook/thumbnails/0e22b55acc549b5b2380da62d86cfed05315be67c874ba3cf6eab149e10b8250.jpg\",\"mediaUrl\":\"https://medias.trendtrack.io/facebook/video/ef720ba6c6fc2d950cdad28ab8e38100aaac4a5d706372f1f943d4f191fe9064.mp4\"},\"advertiser\":{\"id\":\"609920748861095\",\"name\":\"Rosalica\",\"logoUrl\":\"https://medias.trendtrack.io/profile_picture/609920748861095.jpg\",\"facebookPageId\":\"609920748861095\",\"liveAdsCount\":128,\"reach30d\":37983,\"totalReach\":1353958,\"countriesCount\":12,\"facebookLikes\":361,\"instagramFollowers\":null},\"content\":{\"title\":null,\"body\":\"Your pillow isn't causing the puffiness. But it's where you notice it most.Every morning you wake up with a swollen face, a soft jawline, bags under your eyes — and you think it's just sleep. But by midday your stomach still feels heavy. By evening your ankles are tight. You're not just tired. Your body is holding fluid it doesn't know how to move.\\n\\nThat's not aging. That's your lymphatic system running slow.\\n\\nYour lymphatic network is the body's drainage highway — and unlike your heart, it has no pump. It moves when you move. When stress, hormones, diet, or inactivity slow it down, fluid pools. In your face. In your gut. In your legs.\\n\\nThat's why some days you look puffy even when you slept fine. That's why the bloat comes back even when you eat clean. That's why your ankles feel tight even when you haven't been on your feet all day.\\n\\nRosalica™ Lymphatic Drainage Drops don't flush. They support.\\n\\nA blend of five traditional herbs — Lemon Leaf, Burdock Root, Rutin, Red Clover, and Bupleurum — chosen specifically to support the body's natural fluid drainage pathways. Add 20–30 drops to your morning glass of water. That's it.\\n\\nNo harsh water pill feeling. No bathroom panic. No feeling drained by noon.\\n\\nJust a clean morning ritual that helps your body feel lighter, less swollen, and more like itself.\\n\\n60 days to feel the difference. Or your money back\\n\\n.👉 rosalica.com/products/rosalica-lymphatic-drainage-drops\",\"transcript\":\"none\",\"callToAction\":\"SHOP NOW\",\"landingPageUrl\":\"https://rosalica.com/products/rosalica%E2%84%A2-lymphatic-drainage-drops\",\"landingPageDomain\":\"rosalica.com\",\"ctaDescription\":\"Buy 2, Get 1 Free!\",\"ctaLinkDescription\":\"⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐\"},\"metrics\":{\"reach\":30349,\"aggregatedReach\":null,\"estimatedSpend\":273,\"duplicates\":31,\"reachDelta1d\":0,\"reachDelta7d\":150,\"reachDelta30d\":2059},\"audience\":{\"targetedCountries\":[\"AT\",\"AU\",\"CA\",\"DE\",\"DK\",\"ES\",\"FI\",\"FR\",\"GB\",\"IE\",\"NZ\",\"US\"],\"mainCountry\":\"IE\",\"gender\":\"women\",\"ageMin\":18,\"ageMax\":65},\"rank\":{\"positionInPage\":2,\"currentRank\":2,\"rankDelta\":0,\"improvementPct\":1.56},\"flags\":{\"isEuAd\":true,\"isLowReach\":false,\"isMediaChanged\":true,\"hasPartnerBadge\":false}},{\"id\":\"facebook_1012674725000584\",\"collationId\":\"1557280779337930\",\"platform\":\"facebook\",\"status\":\"active\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-07-16T08:53:38.349Z\",\"firstSeenAt\":\"2026-07-15T07:00:00.000Z\",\"lastSeenAt\":\"2026-09-30T01:06:57.769Z\",\"daysRunning\":136,\"media\":{\"type\":\"video\",\"thumbnailUrl\":\"https://medias.trendtrack.io/facebook/thumbnails/6f58c15d0bec6b6ea2212a6966eecf9d449d18f1673970cde140e7db887eaaef.jpg\",\"mediaUrl\":\"https://medias.trendtrack.io/facebook/video/c4463f4ffe439e19d3b90eb75cbdfbd468c40055f304e07aea39861e60103b62.mp4\"},\"advertiser\":{